<title>USA: Fix-Corp retains financial adviser.</title>
<headline>Fix-Corp retains financial adviser.</headline>
<dateline>BEACHWOOD, Ohio 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fix-Corp International Inc said Wednesday that it has retained a financial adviser to consult about its business, &quot;particularly as it may relate to the search for suitable acquisitions for the company.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said it has engaged National Securities Corp in a financial advisory agreement extending in 1998.</p>
<p>Fix-Corp International Inc concentrates on financing purchase orders for customers in wholesaling, distribution and manufacturing.</p>
